{"metadata":{"name":"Sahih al Bukhari","section":{"80":{"eng-name":"Invocations","ara-name":"كتاب الدعوات"}},"section_detail":{"80":{"hadithnumber_first":6304,"hadithnumber_last":6411,"arabicnumber_first":6304,"arabicnumber_last":6411}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":6335,"arabicnumber":6335,"text":"Rapporté par `Aisha : Le Prophète (ﷺ) a entendu un homme réciter le Coran dans la mosquée. Il a dit : « Qu’Allah lui fasse miséricorde, car il m’a rappelé tel verset que j’avais oublié dans telle sourate. »","grades":[{"name":"Imam Bukhari","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":80,"hadith":32},"chapter":{"id":19,"ara-name":"باب قَوْلِ اللَّهِ تَعَالَى {وَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِمْ}","eng-name":"\"... And invoke Allah for them ...\"","isFirstHadith":false}}]}